smart-singbox-installer 2026-06-08.7

Changes:
- DMIT/HK entry profiles now install sing-box-entry-uninstall for full entry-install removal with backup.
- Entry uninstall requires UNINSTALL_ENTRY confirmation and removes entry config, service, info files, relay importer, sb manager and sing-box binary.
- Docs now clearly separate relay deletion, entry uninstall and home uninstall.
- Home Reality installs now ask for a regional Reality handshake/SNI target instead of defaulting to Cloudflare.
- Regional SNI choices: JP www.sony.jp, TW www.cht.com.tw, HK www.hkex.com.hk, US reed.edu, EU www.siemens.com, or custom.
- Custom Reality SNI input is validated as a plain domain.
- One-command interactive installer is now the primary workflow.
- All machines can run: curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xijicao/smart-singbox-installer/main/install.sh | sh
- Installer menu now shows four fixed choices: DMIT entry, HK entry, Home SS2022 only, Home Reality + SS2022.
- Home options auto-select home-debian or home-alpine based on the detected OS.
- Internal file fetch now supports curl first, wget fallback.
- Docs and mind map were updated to remove PROFILE-heavy normal usage and focus on the one-command menu flow.
